From: Denis0x00 <148704309+Denis0x00@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] bootimg: support Android boot image header v2 and add layout tests

Add Android boot image header v2 support (--dtb, dtb_offset, 1660-byte
header verification, page-aligned DTB checks) to scripts/unixnu/bootimg.py
for SM8250/ABL devices such as Lenovo TB-J716F, along with offline unit
tests in scripts/unixnu/test_bootimg.py.
---
